   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve recently installed RRO on Mac OSX 10.8 (to see if it would work). It did not. However, it also broke my base R.</div><div><br></div><div>I removed both, re-installed base R (from the R project) and the re-install still points to RRO. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>How does one completely uninstall RRO?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
