   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px;color:rgb(111,111,111);font-family:&#39;Open Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:23px\">Revolution R Open can work side-by-side with any other version of R on Mac OS X as follows<span style=\"font-size:14px\">:</span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;color:rgb(111,111,111);font-family:&#39;Open Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:23px\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px\">Update your system path to reference <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(199,37,78);white-space:nowrap;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(249,242,244)\">/usr/local/bin</code> <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">before</strong> <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(199,37,78);white-space:nowrap;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(249,242,244)\">/usr/bin</code>.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px\">Install R using the <a href=\"http://brew.sh/\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,136,204);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://brew.sh/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242082078000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15B85DYI4H-H-WAJjkeo6q\">Homebrew Package Manager</a>.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px\">Install Revolution R Open 8.0 <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,136,204);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242082078000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KVIIAbAdcXQnbzbyU0cJH\">using these instructions</a>.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px\">Run Revolution R Open by typing one of the following in your terminal:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(199,37,78);white-space:nowrap;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(249,242,244)\">/usr/bin/R</code></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(199,37,78);white-space:nowrap;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(249,242,244)\">R</code></li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px\">Run R by typing <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(199,37,78);white-space:nowrap;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(249,242,244)\">/usr/local/bin/R</code> in your terminal.</p></li></ol><div><font color=\"#6f6f6f\" face=\"Open Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:18px\"><br></span></font></div><div>Thank you.</div></div>"
